---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import HeroImage from "../assets/hero.png";
---

<section
    class="w-full flex items-center min-h-[95svh] my-0 md:min-h-0 md:my-15 py-15 bg-gray-100"
>
    <article
        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto gap-8 md:gap-6 justify-between lg:gap-12 px-4 py-10 md:py-20"
    >
        <div
            class="flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center md:max-w-lg md:items-start md:text-left lg:max-w-xl"
        >
            <h1
                class="font-black text-[clamp(1.75rem,1.1rem+3vw,3.4rem)] leading-tight text-primary"
            >
                Velas montenegro duran más que las demás
            </h1>
            <h2
                data-animate="fade-up"
                data-animate-delay="0"
                class="text-[clamp(1rem,0.85rem+0.6vw,1.25rem)] font-light max-w-lg"
            >
                Nuestras velas llanas están elaboradas con cera de alta calidad
                y un proceso de fabricación que garantiza un tiempo de
                iluminación prolongado, llama uniforme y mayor duración.
            </h2>
            <div
                data-animate="fade-up"
                data-animate-delay="0.08"
                class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-1 md:justify-start"
            >
                <a
                    href="#cotizacion"
                    class="bg-primary border border-primary text-white px-3 py-1.5 font-medium rounded-sm transition-[background-color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-primary/80 motion-safe:active:scale-[0.97]"
                >
                    Contáctanos
                </a>
                <a
                    href="#catalogo"
                    class="bg-white border border-white text-primary px-3 py-1.5 font-medium rounded-sm transition-[background-color,transform] duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-gray-200 motion-safe:active:scale-[0.97]"
                >
                    Ver catálogo
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div
            data-animate="zoom-in"
            data-animate-delay="0.06"
            class="flex w-full shrink-0 justify-center md:w-auto"
        >
            <img
                src={HeroImage.src}
                alt="Velas Montenegro"
                class="h-56 w-auto object-contain sm:h-72 md:h-96 lg:h-125"
            />
        </div>
    </article>
</section>
